  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "perf(model): optimize DbModel with O(1) direct cell indexing and Utf8Map lookup\n\n      - Implement flat cell offset table (_cellOffsets) for O(1) row/column retrieval\n      - Replace sequential tab scanning in GetCell with direct boundary calculation\n      - Integrate Utf8Map<int> for zero-allocation column lookup by string/span name\n      - Use ArrayPool<int> for all internal indexing tables to maintain absolute 0-alloc\n      - Fix row offset indexing bug by isolating total row offset count from data row count\n      - Benchmark results: GetCell reduced from ~155ns to 37.73ns (~4.1ns/cell), GetByName optimized to 349.63ns with 0 bytes allocated",
